SQLite source 3.54.1 (official test suite)
  URL:      https://www.sqlite.org/2026/sqlite-src-3540100.zip
  SHA-256:  387e7f6cad4797b17848c07d453dc6606917bb356a6cfe5a3abafd38c240c71b
  Contains: test/*.test (1,199 files, 489,129 lines), tester.tcl,
